<title>UK: Cricket-England 2nd inns 23-0 v Australia, 1st test, 4th day.</title>
<headline>Cricket-England 2nd inns 23-0 v Australia, 1st test, 4th day.</headline>
<text>
<p>M.Butcher not out	  14</p>
<p> M.Atherton not out	  5</p>
<p> Extras			  4</p>
<p>=========================.</p>
<p>Australia first innings 118 (A.Caddick 5-50)</p>
<p>England first innings 478-9 declared (N.Hussein 207, G.Thorpe 138, M.Ealham 53)</p>
<p>Australia second innings 477 (M.Taylor 129, G.Blewett 125, M.Elliott 66)</p>
<p>------------------</p>
<p>England require 118 to win.</p>
